.TH SDL_HINT_EMSCRIPTEN_KEYBOARD_ELEMENT 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_EMSCRIPTEN_KEYBOARD_ELEMENT \- Override the binding element for keyboard inputs for Emscripten builds.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_EMSCRIPTEN_KEYBOARD_ELEMENT \(dqSDL_EMSCRIPTEN_KEYBOARD_ELEMENT\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This hint only applies to the emscripten platform\[char46]
.PP
The variable can be one of:
.PP

\(bu \(dq#window\(dq: the javascript window object
.PP
\(bu \(dq#document\(dq: the javascript document object
.PP
\(bu \(dq#screen\(dq: the javascript window\[char46]screen object
.PP
\(bu \(dq#canvas\(dq: the WebGL canvas element
.PP
\(bu \(dq#none\(dq: Don\(aqt bind anything at all
.PP
\(bu any other string without a leading # sign applies to the element on the page with that ID\[char46]
.PP
This hint should be set before creating a window\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

